  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Ukraine Food Security</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">An event focusing on Ukraine and food security. The overall aim is to highlight continuous focus on the war in Ukraine as well as belief in (multilateral) partnerships. The intention is to organize an event with WFP, the World Bank, and other CSO partners, think tanks and members of the new US administration and Congress and create a positive narrative of multilateral engagement with partners in responding to specific needs in Ukraine.</narrative>
  </description>
